{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-4","name":"off","text":"『新キャラクター、登場！』","trans":"“新角色，登场！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030010","name":"off","text":"『大切な人たちを守れる力……\r\n今の甘奈なら、きっと』","trans":"“守护重要之人的力量……\n现在的甘奈，一定可以”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030020","name":"off","text":"『ドレス、汚したらダメ……だから……\r\n怒られないように、守る……！』","trans":"“裙子不能弄脏……所以……\n为了不被骂，我要守护……！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030030","name":"off","text":"『祝福の風で、みんなを癒します……\r\nさぁ、安心して進んで！』","trans":"“用祝福之风，治愈大家……\n来吧，安心前进吧！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-16","name":"off","text":"『アルストロメリア\r\n～幸福を守りし希望の花～』","trans":"“ALSTROEMERIA\n～守护幸福的希望之花～”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030040","name":"甘奈","text":"すごい……！\r\n本当に甘奈たちだ～！","trans":"好厉害……！\n真的是甘奈她们～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030060","name":"千雪","text":"こんなの……\r\n欲しくなっちゃうよね……","trans":"这样的……\n真让人想要呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030070","name":"甘奈","text":"それじゃあ……\r\nまずは甘奈からっ……","trans":"那么……\n先从甘奈开始……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030080","name":"千雪","text":"頑張って……！","trans":"加油……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030100","name":"甘奈","text":"（甜花ちゃんの言ってた通り、なるべく\r\n貯めておいたもん、きっと……）","trans":"（就像甜花说的，尽量\n攒下来的那些，一定……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030110","name":"甘奈","text":"いきますっ！","trans":"我上啦！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030130","name":"千雪","text":"こんなに出ないんだ……","trans":"居然这么难出啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030140","name":"甜花","text":"ま、まだ……\r\n50連、だから……","trans":"还、还……\n才50连，所以……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030150","name":"甘奈","text":"もうアイテムないよ～……","trans":"已经没有道具了～……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030160","name":"甜花","text":"……方法……\r\nまだ、ある……！","trans":"……办法……\n还有……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030180","name":"甜花","text":"リセマラ……！","trans":"刷初始……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030181","name":"甘奈＆千雪","text":"リセマラ……？","trans":"刷初始……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030190","name":"甜花","text":"えと……\r\nこういうの……","trans":"那个……\n就是这种……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030200","name":"甘奈","text":"『アプリを入れた時にもらえるアイテムで、\r\n回せるだけガシャを回します』","trans":"“用安装应用时获得的道具，\n能抽多少次就抽多少次”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030210","name":"甘奈","text":"『目的のキャラクターが出なかったら\r\nデータを消し、同じことを繰り返します』","trans":"“如果没有抽到想要的角色\n就删掉数据，重复同样的操作”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030220","name":"甘奈","text":"……すごい……！\r\nこんなやり方あるんだ……！","trans":"……好厉害……！\n居然还有这种办法……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030230","name":"甜花","text":"でも……\r\n出るまで……大変……","trans":"不过……\n要抽到为止……很辛苦……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030240","name":"甘奈","text":"……\r\n頑張るよ！","trans":"……\n我会努力的！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030250","name":"甘奈","text":"強い甘奈たち、欲しいもん！","trans":"因为想要强大的甘奈她们嘛！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030260","name":"甘奈","text":"じゃあ……\r\n５回目のリセマラ……いくよ……","trans":"那么……\n第5次刷初始……上了哦……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030270","name":"甘奈","text":"……！\r\n甜花ちゃん、この画面……！","trans":"……！\n甜花，这个画面……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030280","name":"甜花","text":"……！\r\n確定演出……！","trans":"……！\n确定演出……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030290","name":"千雪","text":"わぁ、誰だろう？","trans":"哇，会是谁呢？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030310","name":"甘奈","text":"……！\r\n甜花ちゃん！！！","trans":"……！\n甜花！！！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030320","name":"甜花","text":"────ひゃい……！","trans":"────呀啊……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030330","name":"甘奈","text":"あ……ごめん……！\r\nうれしかったから、つい……","trans":"啊……对不起……！\n因为太高兴了，忍不住就……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030340","name":"千雪","text":"ふふっ\r\nやったね♪","trans":"呵呵\n太好了呢♪","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030350","name":"甘奈","text":"うん！","trans":"嗯！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030360","name":"千雪","text":"次は私、やってもいい？\r\n甘奈ちゃんの流れに乗りたいな","trans":"接下来可以让我抽吗？\n想沾沾甘奈的运气呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030380","name":"千雪","text":"えぇっ……！","trans":"诶——……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030390","name":"甜花","text":"ち、千雪さん……","trans":"千、千雪……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030400","name":"甘奈","text":"すごいっ！","trans":"好厉害！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030420","name":"千雪","text":"私だ……！","trans":"是我……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030421","name":"甘奈＆甜花","text":"やったね！","trans":"太好了！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030430","name":"千雪","text":"……！\r\nこんなこと……","trans":"……！\n居然会这样……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030450","name":"甜花","text":"ち、千雪さ……千雪様……！\r\n甜花のも……！","trans":"千、千雪……千雪大人……！\n也请抽甜花的……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030460","name":"千雪","text":"い、いいの……？","trans":"可、可以吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030480","name":"千雪","text":"……\r\nえいっ……！","trans":"……\n嘿咻……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030490","name":"甜花","text":"千雪様……\r\n甜花のおやつ……どうぞ……","trans":"千雪大人……\n这是甜花的点心……请用……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030500","name":"千雪","text":"たまたま……\r\n運がよかっただけだから……！","trans":"只是碰巧……\n运气好而已……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030510","name":"甘奈","text":"ううん、千雪さん\r\nもらってあげて！","trans":"不，千雪\n就收下吧！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030530","name":"甘奈","text":"えぇっ……！？\r\nそ、それは大げさじゃ──","trans":"诶诶……！？\n那、那也太夸张了——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030560","name":"甘奈","text":"甘奈、甜花ちゃんの気持ち\r\n今ならわかるよ……","trans":"甘奈现在\n能明白甜花的心情了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030570","name":"甘奈","text":"おやつをあげなきゃ、って\r\n思っちゃうくらいなの","trans":"会忍不住想\n一定要送点心才行","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014025030580","name":"甘奈","text":"全然、大げさじゃないね……！","trans":"一点都不夸张呢……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}